# The steward's build context, an allow-list: nothing else in the repository, ignored files
# included, reaches the image.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!conformance/schemas
!conformance/clock
!conformance/binding
!reference/steward
# The development dependencies' manifests alone, so the workspace links them; nothing of them is built or shipped.
!conformance/*/package.json
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
reference/steward/test
